for(const [id,name,where]of [['aegis','Aegis Armlet','maintenance-area side ladders'],['starlight','Starlight M-phone','maintenance-area chests'],['maxray','Max Ray','maintenance-area detour'],['masterfist','Master Fist','Shinra HQ item shop chests'],['pile','Pile Banger','Shinra HQ item shop chests'],['grow','Grow Lance','Shinra HQ floor 63'],['behemoth','Behemoth Horn','Shinra HQ stairwell'],['hpshout','HP Shout','Shinra HQ floor 64 locker']])alertEntry(id,'c30',name,'Item','Permanent','Midgar raid · before leaving the city','Search '+where+'. Take the HQ tunnel detour before continuing to the final stairs.','These locations are not a postgame cleanup area.');
alertEntry('midgarturks','c30','Final Turks steals','Event','Window','Midgar tunnels · before resolving the Turks encounter','For equipment, steal Minerva Band from Elena, Touph Ring from Reno, and Ziedrich from Rude. Do all steals before defeating one Turk, because the others leave.','A peaceful resolution skips these steals. Choose consciously; a spare pre-encounter save preserves your options.');
alertEntry('flyer2last','c30','Turtle’s Paradise flyer #2 · last chance','Event','Permanent','Final Shinra HQ visit · lobby','If not read on the first raid, read the lobby notice during this optional detour.','No later return to the Shinra building. Reading this notice completes only one of the six required flyers.');
alertEntry('missing','c30','Missing Score','Item','Permanent','Stairs before Hojo · Barret in the active party','Bring Barret before the ascent and open his weapon chest.','The chest does not appear without Barret. Do not pass this staircase and assume you can return later.');
alertEntry('oritsuru','c31','Oritsuru','Item','Window','Da-chao cave · requires Leviathan Scales','Use the dock’s scales to extinguish the flames and open the weapon chest.','The cave remains, but missing the dock scales permanently blocks this reward.');
alertEntry('stealaswell','c31','Steal as well','Materia','Window','Da-chao cave · requires Leviathan Scales','Extinguish the cave flames and collect the Support Materia.','Missing the scales prevents access, even though Wutai itself is still open.');
alertEntry('trinefinal','c31','Trine · final teacher','Skill','Permanent','Godo at the top of Wutai pagoda','Collect all four Enemy Skill copies first if completing each one. Equip Yuffie with the copies that lack Trine and survive the spell before winning. Do not stack a copy that already knows Trine on her, because that prevents the others learning it.','If Materia Keeper, Gaea’s Cliff and Godo are all finished, Trine cannot be taught by another normal enemy.');
alertEntry('pandora','c32','Pandora’s Box','Skill','Permanent','First Dragon Zombie kill in Northern Cave','Save before the graveyard route. Equip the Enemy Skill copies you want to learn it on living characters; do not drain the first Dragon Zombie’s MP before its death attack.','Treat this as one opportunity per save. If the spell fails or a learner misses it, reload that earlier save.');
alertEntry('zack','c31','The mansion basement memory','Event','Optional','After Cloud’s recovery · before final commitment','Return with Cloud to the Shinra Mansion basement laboratory and inspect the area for the optional memory sequence.','This is optional story content rather than a Disc 1-only scene.');
alertEntry('lucrecia','c31','Vincent’s cave story and rewards','Event','Optional','Submarine or suitable Chocobo · Vincent present','Visit the cave behind the waterfall with Vincent, watch the scene, fight at least ten battles and return for Death Penalty and Chaos.','Recruit Vincent first. The cave remains accessible until you commit to the finale.');
alertEntry('redlast','c31','Bugenhagen’s final visit','Event','Optional','Disc 3 · take Red XIII to Cosmo Canyon','Visit Bugenhagen with Red XIII to see the scene and obtain Limited Moon.','Do this before the final dungeon commitment.');
