const BREED_STEPS=[
['Rent your stables','Breeding opens after obtaining the Highwind. Rent stables at the farm for 10,000 gil each; six gives you room to manage the full route. Gold Saucer racing reopens after Cloud returns.'],
['Prepare supplies','For the standard route, plan at least three Carob Nuts and one Zeio Nut. Steal Carob Nuts from Vlakorados near Bone Village and a Zeio Nut from Goblins on the northeastern Goblin Island. Buy greens for capture and training.'],
['Catch your first parents','Use Chocobo Lure on tracks. Good: Gold Saucer region with the correct Spencer/Flapbeat formation. Great: Mideel tracks with Spiral enemies. Two Great parents also work. Check Billy’s quality appraisal, then keep opposite sexes.'],
['Stabilize the catch','Feed greens in battle while defeating only the accompanying enemies. Send the captured Chocobo to the farm. The outside pen holds four; avoid catching a fifth and displacing one you wanted. Save before moving birds into stalls if you need a different sex.'],
['Train the yellow parents','Buy Sylkis Greens from the Chocobo Sage to improve racing stats. Earn at least four wins combined between the chosen parents. Breeding uses combined wins, rather than merely the letter of the race rank.'],
['Breed blue and green','Mate eligible opposite-sex yellow parents with a Carob Nut. Save first. Repeat after cooldowns to obtain a blue and a green of opposite sexes. A successful special-color roll does not guarantee the particular color or sex you still need.'],
['Breed black','Train the blue and green and accumulate at least nine combined race wins. Mate them with a Carob Nut. Keep room for the offspring and record its sex.'],
['Catch Wonderful','Use the snowy tracks near Icicle Inn. Look for the Chocobo with Jumping rabbit enemies, then confirm Billy calls it Wonderful. You need the sex opposite your black Chocobo.'],
['Breed gold','Earn at least twelve combined wins between black and Wonderful. Choose the black parent FIRST and use a Zeio Nut. The selection order matters because of the breeding bug. Save before trying.'],
['Visit all four caves','Green crosses mountains to Mime near Wutai. Blue crosses rivers/shallows to Quadra Magic near Mideel. Black combines both to reach HP↔MP north of Corel. Gold crosses the ocean to Knights of Round on the unmarked northeast island.']
];
